# /opt/prd-shared/.env.prod — shared platform config for the droplet.
# Copy to .env.prod on the production droplet. chmod 600.
# App-specific secrets go in env/myapp.env (not here); the per-app image SHA
# pin lives in .env.myapp-deploy (written by CI / deploy.sh).

# --- Redis DB index registry ---
# Track allocations so apps never collide on a shared Valkey instance.
# Allocation matches backend/app/core/config.py:
# myapp: /0 (app cache), /1 (celery broker), /2 (celery results)
